msgstr "平均分攤"

#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_budget.field_account_budget_line__distribution
msgid ""
"Spread Evenly: the amount is expected little by little over the period.\n"
"At a Date: the whole amount is expected on the planned date, e.g. a yearly fee."
msgstr ""
"平均分攤：金額在期間內逐步預期發生。\n"
"於指定日期：全部金額預期在計劃日期發生，例如年費。"

