#. module: om_account_budget
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_budget.field_res_company__budget_exceeded_email
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_budget.field_res_config_settings__budget_exceeded_email
msgid ""
"When an expense line of a validated budget goes over its planned amount, its"
" responsible gets an email besides the To-Do activity."
msgstr "當已驗證預算的費用明細超出其計劃金額時，除了待辦事項活動外，其負責人還會收到電郵。"

#. module: om_account_budget
